- **Version configuration**: [VERSION](mdc:VERSION)
- **Build system**: [src/c/autonomy-daemon/Makefile](mdc:src/c/autonomy-daemon/Makefile)

## Core Components
- **Core types and definitions**: [src/c/autonomy-daemon/core/types.h](mdc:src/c/autonomy-daemon/core/types.h)
