- **GPS System**: [src/c/autonomy-daemon/gps/](mdc:src/c/autonomy-daemon/gps/) - GPS tracking and location services
- **Utilities**: [src/c/autonomy-daemon/utils/](mdc:src/c/autonomy-daemon/utils/) - Common utilities and helpers

## Configuration and Management
- **UCI Manager**: [src/c/autonomy-daemon/utils/uci_manager.c](mdc:src/c/autonomy-daemon/utils/uci_manager.c) - UCI configuration management
